  "question": {
    "text": "The rate of a reaction decreased by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>555</mn></math>&nbsp;times when the temperature was changed from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>to</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>. the activation energy (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>kJ</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) of the reaction is ________ .",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "100",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.303</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.555</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.303</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>303</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>313</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.268</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>.314</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>303</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>Ea</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Ea</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kJ</mi></math></p>",
